direction: down
title: "C23 saved results: restore escrow and completion-record retirement"
"Saved A" -> "Restore escrow": "retain A while old-current B disposes"
"Old current B" -> "Reentrant new C": "protected publication requires managed adapter; not raw equivalence"
"Restore escrow" -> "Interpreter A": "commit only after known B and C settlement"
"Saved A" -> "Discard unknown": "retain opaque operation and provider; do not retry hook"
"Invocation done" -> "Completion record retained": "saved results, ACK producers and observers can still refer"
"Closed issuer and observer gate" -> "Prior reader drain": "close is not a grace period"
"Prior reader drain" -> "Record retirement": "result closure and completion evidence also required"
"Record retirement" -> "Generation slot reuse": "stable anchor rejects old ACK before record access"
